# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment variables (placeholders only — never commit real values)
# Set real values in Netlify: Site configuration → Environment variables.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ecwid PUBLIC API token (read-only, safe in the browser). When set, the shop,
# product pages and cards read products, prices, specs and categories from
# Ecwid (store 99673270). When empty, the bundled catalog in src/data is used.
# Create it in Ecwid: Apps → My apps → (custom app) → public token.
VITE_ECWID_PUBLIC_TOKEN=
